  "answer": "This look feels a bit unbalanced because the dark burgundy trousers are too far from your face, which can wash you out, and their high contrast with your khaki blazer creates a jarring gap. Swapping those pants for lighter grey trousers would ground your outfit perfectly and let the colors blend harmoniously.",
