      "text": "Your milky beige boots are a lovely anchor here; they sit right in your natural palette and provide a soft bridge between the darker elements."
    },
    {
      "about": "silhouette",
      "items": ["p1", "p1-2", "p2"],
      "text": "The combination of the structured blazer top and the wide-leg trousers creates a flattering, elongated silhouette that looks modern and effortless."
